      <groundspeak:encoded_hints>30 CM BGL 2.2 M S LIGHT STANDRD

G.S.C. DEEP BENCH MARK IN MANHOLE.ALONG HWY #3, 0.3 KM NE OF POST OFFICE; 2.2 M S OF A LIGHT STANDARD.

